  {
   "id": "scarlet-nexus-133302@1.04",
   "gameId": "scarlet-nexus-133302",
   "displayName": "Update 1.04",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-09-30T14:02:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Upcoming New Paid DLC Pack \"Bond Enhancement Pack 1\"",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The new bond level \"EX\" will be added to the bond system and players will be able to further enhance their bonds with their allies!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enjoy the 10 new bond episodes, 5 for each Yuito's and Kasane's story. Different from the base game, the new episodes will depict bonds between allies. Discover new sides and experience the deepened bonds between allies and the protagonists.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gifting new presents to liven up your hideout, enhance bonds, get photos and also matched attachments from your friends as well!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Leveling up to bond level \"EX\" will unlock \"Crush Vision\", a new move that is extremely useful in battles!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, a new additional costume set, “Fairy Tale Attire” will be made available. Created by character designer and illustrator Yusuke Kozaki, the costume set's design is based on the motif of fairy tales.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A weapon set which is designed based on the \"Fairy Tale Attire\" will also be available.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Upcoming Free Update Ver.1.04",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The free update patch Ver.1.04 has also been announced!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players will be able to continue enjoying the world of SCARLET NEXUS by getting various rewards through the new \"Challenges\", new plugins through shop exchange and also new brain talk messages that are related to the new contents added.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rewards for \"Challenges\" include not only attachments and costume variations, but also \"Weapon Skins\" where you can change only the appearence of your equipped weapon to what you already possess.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New plugins include the ones that increase the activation probability of Assault Vision and Combo Vision, control over activation timing of Brain Drive, and more!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "These new contents will be coming soon, so please stay tuned!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
